      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAYFAIR SHINE (1) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 8 length 5th at Wentworth Park (30.41). Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. ROSMARINO (2) pinged the lids and led for most of the way to hold a minor placing when second and beaten 0.8 lengths (26.02) at this track in a Grade 5 over 450m. Can feature again. NIP OF SCOTCH (8) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and two minors from six tries. Below best last time at Q Parklands (31.23) in a Grade 6, finishing a 15 length seventh. Looks one of the chances. SANDAVE MASON (6) profiles nicely over this trip.",
